# Billing (signed in; see auth.http). Needs the Stripe test keys in server/.env and
# a running: stripe listen --forward-to localhost:8080/api/billing/webhook
# Test card in Checkout: 4242 4242 4242 4242, any future date and CVC.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@origin = http://localhost:3000

### Plan, limits, this month's usage and renewal date
GET {{baseUrl}}/billing

### Start an upgrade — returns the URL the browser should open
POST {{baseUrl}}/billing/checkout
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plan": "pro"
}

### Confirm after coming back from checkout (?checkout=<session> in the app URL)
POST {{baseUrl}}/billing/confirm
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "PASTE_CHECKOUT_SESSION_ID"
}

### Stripe customer portal (card, plan change, cancel, invoices) — 400 without a subscription
POST {{baseUrl}}/billing/portal
Origin: {{origin}}

### Webhook — Stripe calls this; locally use: stripe listen --forward-to localhost:8080/api/billing/webhook
# An unsigned request must answer 400.
POST {{baseUrl}}/billing/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "customer.subscription.updated"
}
